<title>USA: U.S. blue chips lower as bonds fall,techs positive.</title>
<headline>U.S. blue chips lower as bonds fall,techs positive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks moved slighlty lower in opening trading, following bonds lower.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial Average was off 5 at 6075.</p>
</text>
